  offerLine: Well, well. Look who's finally come home. And I see you've found the old cafe. Not much left of it, is there?
  activeLine: Come here, let me have a look at you.
  readyLine: 'Fix it up? You? ...Hah! It''s that gecko you used to moon over, isn''t it? Don''t answer. A cafe needs a first dish. Here: my leaf salad. Three handfuls of leaves, that''s all it takes.'
  doneLine: A recipe's no good without leaves, mind.
